From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sweepikun <laomgba@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf: cache Brain memory conditions and reuse sensing sets

Keep Brain memory-condition results valid only while the owning brain and
memory version remain unchanged. Escape through the debug map disables the
cache and native eligibility snapshot. Skip non-expiring vanilla memory
values while retaining callbacks for custom ExpirableValue subclasses.

Use generation stamps for Sensing's seen/unseen sets so per-tick clears
avoid filling the backing arrays.
---
